# Chrome Origin Trial token for HTML-in-Canvas (Bend).
# Register at: https://developer.chrome.com/origintrials
# Search for "HTML-in-Canvas" / CanvasDrawElement, then register:
#   - http://localhost:5173  (local Vite)
#   - https://your-production-domain.com
# Paste the token below (never commit the real .env).
VITE_ORIGIN_TRIAL_TOKEN=
